# llama-regression.log — fixed-prompt logits/token-ID stability across 7C

The same self-contained probe (qaqc-probes/probe_llama_regression.py) runs on
the parent 8426ec6 and on the 7C candidate. Byte-identical output (logits
sha256 + greedy chain + generate_ids) proves the llama-family path is unchanged.

